"023:001 And these are the last words of David. Faithful is David the son of Jessae, and faithful the man whom the Lord raised up to be the anointed of the God of Jacob, and beautiful are the psalms of Israel.",
"023:002 The Spirit of the Lord spoke by me, and his word was upon my tongue.",
"023:003 The God of Israel says, A watchman out of Israel spoke to me a parable: I said amongst men, How will you strengthen the fear of the anointed?",
"023:004 And in the morning light of God, let the sun arise in the morning, from the light of which the Lord passed on, and as it were from the rain of the tender grass upon the earth.",
"023:005 For my house is not so with the Mighty One: for he has made an everlasting covenant with me, ready, guarded at every time; for all my salvation and all my desire is, that the wicked should not flourish.",
"023:006 All these are as a thorn thrust forth, for they shall not be taken with the hand,",
"023:007 and a man shall not labour amongst them; and one shall have that which is fully armed with iron, and the staff of a spear, and he shall burn them with fire, and they shall be burnt in their shame.",
"023:008 These are the names of the mighty men of David: Jebosthe the Chananite is a captain of the third part: Adinon the Asonite, he drew his sword against eight hundred soldiers at once.",
"023:009 And after him Eleanan the son of his uncle, son of Dudi who was amongst the three mighty men with David; and when he defied the Philistines they were gathered there to war, and the men of Israel went up.",
"023:010 He arose an struck the Philistines, until his hand was weary, and his hand clave to the sword: and the Lord wrought a great salvation in that day, and the people rested behind him only to strip the slain.",
"023:011 And after him Samaia the son of Asa the Arachite: and the Philistines were gathered to Theria; and there was there a portion of ground full of lentiles; and the people fled before the Philistines.",
"023:012 And he stood firm in the midst of the portion, and rescued it, and struck the Philistines; and the Lord wrought a great deliverance.",
"023:013 And three out of the thirty went down, and came to Cason to David, to the cave of Odollam; and there was an army of the Philistines, and they encamped in the valley of Raphain.",
"023:014 And David was then in the strong hold, and the garrison of the Philistines was then in Bethleem.",
"023:015 And David longed, and said, Who will give me water to drink out of the well that is in Bethleem by the gate? now the band of the Philistines was then in Bethleem.",
"023:016 And the three mighty men broke through the host of the Philistines, and drew water out of the well that was in Bethleem in the gate: and they took it, and brought it to David, and he would not drink it, but poured it out before the Lord.",
"023:017 And he said, O Lord, forbid that I should do this, that I should drink of the blood of the men who went at the risk of their lives: and he would not drink it. These things did these three mighty men.",
"023:018 And Abessa the brother of Joab the son of Saruia, he was chief amongst the three, and he lifted up his spear against three hundred whom he killed; and he had a name amongst three.",
"023:019 Of those three he was most honourable, and he became a chief over them, but he reached not to the first three.",
"023:020 And Banaeas the son of Jodae, he was abundant in mighty deeds, from Cabeseel, and he struck the two sons of Ariel of Moab: and he went down and struck a lion in the midst of a pit on a snowy day.",
"023:021 He struck an Egyptian, a wonderful man, and in the hand of the Egyptian was a spear as the side of a ladder; and he went down to him with a staff, and snatched the spear from the Egyptian's hand, and killed him with his own spear.",
"023:022 These things did Banaeas the son of Jodae, and he had a name amongst the three mighty men.",
"023:023 He was honourable amongst the second three, but he reached not to the first three: and David made him his reporter. And these are the names of King David's mighty men.",
"023:024 Asael Joab's brother; he was amongst the thirty. Eleanan son of Dudi his uncle in Bethleem.",
"023:025 Saema the Rudaean.",
"023:026 Selles the Kelothite: Iras the son of Isca the Thecoite.",
"023:027 Abiezer the Anothite, of the sons of the Anothite.",
"023:028 Ellon the Aoite; Noere the Netophatite.",
"023:029 Esthai the son of Riba of Gabaeth, son of Benjamin the Ephrathite; Asmoth the Bardiamite; Emasu the Salabonite:",
"023:030 Adroi of the brooks.",
"023:031 Gadabiel son of the Arabothaeite.",
"023:032 the sons of Asan, Jonathan;",
"023:033 Samnan the Arodite; Amnan the son of Arai the Saraurite.",
"023:034 Aliphaleth the son of Asbites, the son of the Machachachite; Eliab the son of Achitophel the Gelonite.",
"023:035 Asarai the Carmelite the son of Uraeoerchi.",
"023:036 Gaal the son of Nathana. The son of much valour, the son of Galaaddi. Elie the Ammanite.",
"023:037 Gelore the Bethorite, armour-bearer to Joab, son of Saruia.",
"023:038 Iras the Ethirite. Gerab the Ethenite.",
"023:039 Urias the Chettite: thirty-seven in all."
